    "chunk_text": "eade ymbe \u00fea bote swa georne swa man scolde, ac d\u00e6ghwamlice man ihte And we eac for\u00feam habba\u00f0 fela byrsta & bysmara gebiden, & gif we \u00e6nige bote gebidan scylan, \u00feonne For\u00feam mid miclan earnungan we geearnedan \u00fea yrm\u00f0a \u00fee us onsitta\u00f0, & mid swy\u00fee micelan La hw\u00e6t, we witan ful georne \u00fe\u00e6t to miclan bryce sceal micel bot nyde, & to miclan bryne w\u00e6ter And micel is nyd\u00feearf manna gehwilcum \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes lage gyme heonanfor\u00f0 georne & Godes gerihta On h\u00e6\u00feenum \u00feeodum ne dear man forhealdan lytel ne micel \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee gelagod is to gedwolgoda And ne dear man gewanian on h\u00e6\u00feenum \u00feeodum inne ne ute \u00e6nig \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00feinga \u00fee gedwolgodna broht And Godes \u00feeowas syndan m\u00e6\u00fee & munde gewelhw\u00e6r bed\u00e6lde; & gedwolgoda \u00feenan ne dear man Ac so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, \u00feearf is \u00fe\u00e6re bote, for\u00feam Godes gerihta wandean to lange innan \u00feysse \u00feeode &, hr\u00e6dest is to cwe\u00feenne, Godes laga la\u00f0e & lara forsawene. And \u00fe\u00e6s we habba\u00f0 ealle \u00feurh Godes yrre bysmor gelome, gecnawe se \u00f0e cunne; & se byrst wyr\u00f0 For\u00feam hit is on us eallum swutol & gesene \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6r \u00feysan oftor br\u00e6can \u00feonne we bettan, & \u00fey is Ne dohte hit nu lange inne ne ute, ac w\u00e6s here & hunger, bryne & blodgyte, on gewelhwylcan ende oft And",
